Title: Being Salaryman
Author: Pistol Taeja
Genre: Isekai
Format: Manga
Status: One Shot

# PAGE 1 INT. AMERICAN MUSIC STUDIO

Panel 1 [GROUP]
Two music artists are mid interview, BADDIE the upcoming artist and CID the veteran.

    BADDIE
    That's nice,

    BADDIE
    Now tell us how you do it,

Panel 2

    BADDIE
    Cid

Panel 3 [WIDE]

    CID
    When success hits, ride it like you're fisting a gorilla.

    TITLE Cincinnati Cid | (19)

Panel 4 [GROUP]

    BADDIE
    Word, monkeys. These days are pretty round.

    TITLE Minnesota Baddie | (19)

Panel 5
    Baddie sets his eyes on the chain dangling from Cid's neck.

Panel 6

    CID
    Whatchu on?

# PAGE 2

Panel 1 [GROUP]
    Baddie makes his approach towards Cid.

    BADDIE
    When a person meets someone as successful as you,

    BADDIE
    It's motivational.

    CID
    Oh?

Panel 2
    A GOLDEN NECKLACE sparkles around Cid's neck.

    BADDIE
    This fine trinket really suits you.

Panel 3 [WIDE]
    Baddie holds it up with pride.

    CID
    Thanks, I was going for 'slender'...
    
Panel 4
    He makes his move and is gone! Baddie bolts out of the room, necklace in hand.  Cid is frozen, arm stretched out.

Panel 5
    Cid snaps to it and chases after Baddie. 

    CID
    Oi, Come back!

# PAGE 3 EXT. STUDIO BUILDING ENTRANCE

Panel 1 [BLEED]
    Cid runs across the street only to receive an interview with a trunk.

    SFX SHREEEEK

Panel 2
    Cid is in shock as his end approaches.

    CID
    (thought)
    It's the legendary...

    CID
    (thought)
    Truck-kun of reincarnation!

Panel 3
    Darkness. Farewell Cid.

Panel 4
    Cid's eyes open slowly to see a man in a medic outfit.

    MEDIC
    Hey!

    MEDIC
    Are you ok?

Panel 5

The area is sprawling with people as Cid lays on the floor, a medic helps him up while other medics deal with another matter nearby.

    CID
    (thought)
    I survived.

    MEDIC
    It's gonna be fine. I'm a medic.

    CID
    (thought)
    It was an ambulance?!

    MEDIC
    Do you remember your name?

# PAGE 4 EXT. CITY STREETS

Panel 1 [GROUP]
    Cid shoots upright. His face, determined.

    CID
    My chain.

    CID
    Baddie... I have to get it back!

Panel 2
    Cid throws his arms away from the medic holding him back

        MEDIC
        We still have to get you to a hospital.

        CID
        No way, A hospital bill is worse than losing my chain!

Panel 3 [GROUP] [BLEED]
    Cid falls over in front of TRUCK-KUN on its missing to assist him.

Panel 4 [GROUP]
    Desperation of a sad reality sets into his face.
    
    CID
    (thought)
    FFS

    CID
    Is this the real one?!

# PAGE 5 EXT. CROSS SECTION

    Panel 1
    BAM fills the void.

    Panel 2
    Darkness.

    Panel 3 [V] 
    Cid is cold, sad and forgetful.

        CID
        Hmmm. I died this time.

        CID
        Where am I...?

    Panel 4 [BLEED]
    Cid looks up in shock at the ISEKAI ROULETTE WHEEL.

    KING, CLOWN, TEACHER...

# PAGE 6 INT. DARKNESS / WHEEL OF GASHA

    Panel 1
        CID
        I guess it's time to roll for a new life...

    SFX CREAK

    Panel 2
    A smile beams across his face, Cid ponders what great fortune awaits him if this is all real.

    Panel 3
    Cid looks on with glee at the wheel as it spins.

    CID
    Maybe I can be reborn in a dungeon and cast crazy magic n shit.
    
    CID
    Or, That time I was reborn as a prince of a nation with a harem of women, one for each race of planets including some mermaids and cardevoir.

    Panel 4
    The wheel turns... Warrior, Dragon, Dungeon Boss.

        CID
        C'mon. C'mon.

        CID
        Give me a good one...!

    Panel 5
    Fate has been crossed.

    SFX THUD

# PAGE 7 INT. BUILDING - TOILET STALL

    Panel 1
    It's sunrise. A high concrete and glass skyline sprouts from the darkness.

    Panel 2
    Trouses down, ass sat on a toilet, Cid comes to his senses.

    Panel 3
    He looks left, right, then back again.

        CID
        Whoa...Where am I?

    Panel 4
    Cid presses buttons on the toilet, his exits are now clear.

    SFX BEEP

    Panel 5
    Gentle relief sinks into his Cid's face.

    SFX VRRRM

# PAGE 8 INT. BUILDING - OFFICE HALLWAY

    Panel 1
    Cid exits the toilets.

    CID
    This isn't a dungeon. It's my planet but...

    Panel 2
    Men side by side.

    Panel 3
    Shoulder to shoulder with their arms behind their backs. Chant in unison.

        MEN
        Ossu

        MEN
        Ossu

    Panel 4
    Their faces light up. Cid is widemouthed behind them.

# PAGE 9 INT. BUILDING - OFFICE SPACE

    Panel 1

        CID
        (thought)
        A rising sun...

        CID
        a morning ritual in suits...

    Panel 2
    An army of cubicles sat by an army of office workers.

    Panel 3
    Sweat drips down his face.

    SFX GULP

    Panel 4
    Cid takes  step closer to a desk made just for him.

# PAGE 10

    Panel 1 [SPREAD]
    
    CID
    Dear world, I've been reincarnated as a Japanese Salaryman in a sales department.
